  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.12fd7c084015": "Fabricates a permanent acceleration ring and nav relay on the clear line to this claim’s linked station. Travel Burn is amplified only while the ship remains inside that physical corridor.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.285ed5f73a7f": "Automated turret that protects the body from raids. Required on dangerous frontier claims.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.2b701c74fca8": "Runs the fitted battery as a garrison. Warns of raids on your claims in this sector and contests them with stationed guns. Highest upkeep; produces nothing.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.55f3c82f7f16": "Auto-refines raw ore into materials at a fixed rate, no station visit needed. Lighter, dearer goods to ship.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.72ee331c6bd2": "Runs the fitted refinery as a working site. Deliver raw ore here; crews process it into refined goods you haul out. Stocked sites draw raiders in low-security space.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.82bd0b7e236a": "Runs the fitted depot as a freight relay. Deposit goods; scheduled convoys haul them to the linked station and sell at the local market price less the relay fee. Convoys risk piracy in low-security space.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.ad7c24a20084": "Links this body to a chosen station. Collapses your worst lane to a single jump — classic automation that rewrites the map.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.b4719cabddda": "A dropoff point for your drones. Drones assigned a depot template route here. Stores overflow ore.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.ed653dbc9994": "Extends discovery pulses to hidden POIs across this claim’s sector and files one free local rumor card per sector-day. It does not reveal exact positions or widen combat contact scans.",
