  "loc.src.data.frontierregions.west.field.body.2914ab78ab15": "The drill mast fell inward through a hollow asteroid. Ordinary probes return without telemetry; the snapped auger is folded against something harder than drill-steel.",
  "loc.src.data.frontierregions.west.field.body.6659f369824f": "The carrier Void-Reach died upside-down. Reach stalls now crowd its upturned belly while launch rails hang over the market like teeth.",
