  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.entryline.247af887f905": "Industrial traffic inbound. Match vector or clear the lane.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.entryline.2f0ac1d0bcb2": "Raider claim ahead. Read the warning before committing.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.entryline.31a0dd86e5a7": "Active seam. Work clean and clear the haul lane.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.entryline.38500b4dc185": "Research signal unstable. Triangulate before closing range.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.entryline.beedfb7b2196": "Licensed yard. Hold vector for traffic control.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.entryline.e3d43fe67c93": "Cold hull. Scan first; salvage only what answers.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.objective.3677d23baac0": "See one convoy through the lane.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.objective.490033aa34ba": "Break two hostile actors after engagement is authorized.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.objective.7bbb340a8375": "Scan from three distinct local bearings.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.objective.8f0a54b36e07": "Dock cleanly inside local traffic control.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.objective.cc41a7862229": "Finish one physical salvage recovery.",
  "loc.src.data.poibehaviorfamilies.field.objective.d7617a8273a4": "Recover three registered yields from the field.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.10b53144691b": "A blind response turns a traffic complaint into collective punishment.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.1d70031ac4a5": "The route moved, but the missing receipt leaves payment and cause unresolved.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.2e0e694d7156": "The erased loss merges with the field and the desk fails its witness.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.35d7924709d8": "The clerk is indexed and the quiet channel acquires a public owner.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.47ee89b2ef85": "A chart without a physical sample remains an untested frontier story.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.51b59ed283ee": "Without the chips, 47-B becomes another allegation without custody.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.560efa39ebf1": "The badge protects paper while civilian route capacity burns.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.58f9362165ab": "A one-way delivery is charity, not a durable frontier route.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.5d626242ca5e": "Without a second region the recurrence remains a story, not a measurement.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.5dbbb21bec1e": "A scan makes the timing edge public before the route can exploit it.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.5f76d9f6643e": "The broker vanishes with the only buyer list for the recurrence.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.6f0b46e62970": "The uncharted pockets remain rumor and navigational danger.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.776fd2150549": "The proposed civilian route fails its first practical load.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.7784153aab65": "Without testimony the escort becomes another unverifiable patrol claim.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.7fee3d0c6304": "Publication without inspection becomes another remote administrative claim.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.884315680f87": "An unverified shelter trail can hide either safety or another disappearance.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.8c03e72b77d2": "The replacement manifest closes without a surviving comparison load.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.8c4335330dc8": "A lost extract lets the institution deny that the erased crew existed.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.8ccc33308e46": "Lost receipts leave the relief route vulnerable to tracing and extortion.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.8eda4b1478f8": "Duplicated keys turn your channel into a pirate toll map.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.a0e920849a45": "The open route begins without a witness or a chart.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.a358b9cd1f2d": "The carrier loss turns the ignored discrepancy into a route shortage.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.b6b0baa5a0f9": "Dione loses the relief lot and the channel becomes an empty abstraction.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.bc4caa2a9578": "Lost calibration leaves the loop private and unverifiable.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.c4375fb21191": "The recurrence decays into ordinary Ashfall noise.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.c728c99325cf": "The black route becomes evidence tied to the identity you erased.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.cd1bb6d7cd9e": "A sanction without evidence becomes indistinguishable from confiscation.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.f492f6dbd51f": "The discrepancy enters the ledger as acceptable transit loss.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.f4f3b4a309d5": "The failed sanction emboldens the marked cell and frightens neutral carriers.",
  "loc.src.data.postendingreplaychains.field.failuretext.f98c21282b0b": "The witness disappears and the private archive becomes hearsay.",
