  "loc.src.data.worldsitemanifests.field.name.c1e9c7c5567b": "Wreck Cathedral",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.body.459eddfad7b2": "Clamp scoring and displaced fasteners face outward from the fly-through cavity. The carried device was released from inside the Vigilant rather than torn away by an external collision.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.body.795c97ecaea3": "Registry geometry identifies the wreck as the Concord Vigilant despite the missing transponder core. The surviving frame spacing and bridge profile exclude every other hull in the convoy manifest.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.body.80764713fdbf": "The emergency relay clock lost synchronization before the structural breakup recorded by the hull sensors. Whatever stopped the convoy interrupted its coordination channel before it tore the Vigilant apart.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.body.e0d28ef6de26": "The navigation record terminates inside Ceres without a gate-exit acknowledgment. Its final vectors converge on the split capital hull now catalogued as the Wreck Cathedral.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.body.e37e4f43e59e": "The recovered black box binds the convoy route, relay clock, and internal release to one custody record. Its final entry identifies a classified archive package, but not the party that ordered the transfer.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.title.0b7812fdede9": "What Was Carried",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.title.4ba23ad54491": "The Clock Stopped First",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.title.5b99f579f098": "The Missing Convoy",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.title.78c96beb7bfa": "Released From Inside",
  "loc.src.data.wreckcathedralevidencecatalog.field.title.ccffa6b91aef": "Capital Hull Located",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.117059a6cf7b": "A recent loss — cargo still largely intact, if you reach it before the scavengers.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.611337ec4e86": "Drifted here long before the lane was charted. Mostly picked clean; the black box may still read.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.8b8677b0bb58": "Shot to pieces in a fight the sim recorded here. Salvageable, but hot — cut carefully.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.95645f2f8160": "A Concord-flagged hull. Stripping it without a permit is a crime — Concord fines, the Quiet launders.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.dc579d5d7bf3": "Scattered hull plating. Slim pickings, but nobody will ask questions.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.458544b183de": "Wreck Debris",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.e375c14ee045": "Ancient Derelict",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.eec525acdb04": "Fresh Wreck",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.fa9d01c97860": "Military Wreck",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.fb945801255f": "Battlefield Wreck",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.33dd7bf26b8d": "Choir goodwill; no look inside.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.4230d3bfb760": "Slow, risky, but the crew tag buys you Concord goodwill.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.580a0e5ddb76": "The box vanishes into a drawer. The 0.7t stays moisture. You keep the fee — and the column.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.8f24f889e29c": "Knowledge and heat. Possibly both.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.99e70c1354fd": "Meridian clears the position again. You take the margin. The Pit buys its air twice.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.9f0ac592bcd7": "The Collective refiles the dead by name. No bounty. The moisture-loss column closes for Shaft 7.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.ad2f1993719d": "No pay. The Pit breathes one cycle on air it was already owed.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.fb6be5d3979d": "Faster credits now — and no witnesses.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.2ab4cce5cbb7": "Sell to the off-station buyer",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.4d0d130de08e": "Return to the Pit dock",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.6090ddbf9597": "Sell it to Meridian",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.998c7947a8f3": "Tow the pod to a station",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.b9bb96a5cdd1": "Hand it to Drift Claims",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.c347a533dabd": "Strip the pod for salvage",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.d248e6073382": "Deliver sealed",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.d9e46197fec9": "Break the wax",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.prompt.69432fdb4d76": "The pod is failing. What do you do?",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.prompt.982cfc045877": "The canisters are the Pit\\u2019s own replacement. Where do they go?",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.prompt.d92a1efeba40": "The hold seals are ritual-waxed. What do you do?",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.prompt.ecabe22c71b1": "The box proves the 0.7t was two names. Who gets it?",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.038cb01b17ac": "Recover the hauler black box whose mass log is the cover for two missing Drift miners. Deliver it — to the buyer who pays, or the one who counts.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.1493ae830a83": "A Quiet bounty chip names a bearing, not a face. Hunt the ghost before the contract expires.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.1faa7c082e96": "Recover the nav core and scan the marked mine drop bearings before another convoy dies in the wake.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.5b5c22a1db5e": "Tether the drifting Silt canisters out of the wreck field and sell the pressurized air.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.5eec452632fc": "Pull the escort black box so insurers can price PD screens against raider missile racks.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.61e1f45e4c13": "A float of rebreathed air drifts off a wreck — relief stock resold to the station it was taken from. Haul it to a buyer, or back to the people who breathed it first.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.6297b416a9ed": "The wreck log fingers a specific raider. Track the marked hostile and put them down.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.949f65a9245b": "A sealed Choir offering drifts free of a wreck. Deliver it unopened — or open it and live with the Pattern.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.9d202a468e7c": "Recover an encrypted courier chip for The Quiet. Ask no questions, get paid.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.bacc0ab80b97": "A single survivor drifts in a failing pod. Haul them to safety — or leave the pod for the scrap.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.dc4c1158ae53": "Recover the freighter data core and deliver it to a station buyer who has been asking questions.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.f0a652aa1c87": "Pull the flight recorder from the wreck and carry it to a station; its log names the attackers.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.title.1ef28a9d5fa0": "The Shaft Seven Box",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.title.236f84c57cef": "Unfinished Offering",
