  "loc.src.systems.asteroidformationmodel.field.blurb.1160a4e82042": "One dominant mass with satellites. The obvious place to sink a Core.",
  "loc.src.systems.asteroidformationmodel.field.blurb.6322a918407a": "Two bodies holding station on each other. Short hauls, thin cover.",
  "loc.src.systems.asteroidformationmodel.field.blurb.9b920816f6d7": "A drawn-out ribbon of debris. Long lanes, long exposure.",
  "loc.src.systems.asteroidformationmodel.field.blurb.bc63b4f8d850": "A single rock, standing alone. Every face is an approach.",
  "loc.src.systems.asteroidformationmodel.field.blurb.d72b6184a872": "Packed tight enough to hide in and hard enough to shed heat into.",
  "loc.src.systems.asteroidformationmodel.field.blurb.e3087e20c93b": "Loose, scattered, unremarkable. Cheap to work, cheap to lose.",
